flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. The owner makes a secret, sets TOTP_SECRET,<br/>restarts and adds it to the authenticator by<br/>hand; a bad secret stops the start with a<br/>message.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. The login shows Password and Code; Enter in the<br/>password moves to the code.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. A wrong code says 'Wrong password or code. A<br/>code works once: wait for the next one.' and<br/>both fields are empty again.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S4["4. The same code used in a second browser inside<br/>its 30 seconds is refused with 'A code works<br/>once: wait for the next one.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. After 5 wrong codes in a row: 'Wrong password<br/>or code. Wait 60 seconds before the next try.',<br/>then 'Too many tries. Wait 59 seconds, then try<br/>again.'; the right code during the hold names<br/>the time left, and after the wait it logs in.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. Browsers logged in before stay logged in; API<br/>tokens need no code.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. More, Signed in: each browser with its sign in<br/>day and last use, this one marked.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. Two browsers of one kind read the same, 'Chrome<br/>on macOS', with no address or place to tell<br/>them apart.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S9["9. Sign out, or Sign out all others, asks for the<br/>app password; a wrong one says 'Wrong<br/>password'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S10["10. Done: 'Other browsers signed out'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S11["11. The signed out browser keeps showing every<br/>bookmark until it next asks the server for<br/>something.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S12["12. Lost the authenticator: remove TOTP_SECRET and<br/>restart.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> S9
  S9 --> S10
  S10 --> S11
  S11 --> S12
